tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RSDNTWK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RSDNTWK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RSDNTWK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RSDNTWK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RSDNTWK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-25T16:56:38Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T17:01:58Z","body":"> I am concerned this is a lot of increased final binary size in the templates. Can you calculate the difference on the same version with lzma in and lzma not in?\r\n\r\nThe changes are surprisingly small for example a windows template release exe only had like a 10k overall difference between the base 4.6.3 and the 7-zip addition and the pattern was around the same for other platforms too.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4535855455/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4536003879","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119725#issuecomment-4536003879","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119725","id":4536003879,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDl3tJw","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subsc