e_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-25T17:41:26Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T17:41:26Z","body":"> So 10 kilobytes difference between base 4.6.3 and the 7-zip addition for windows template release exe?\r\n\r\nCorrect as it showed 72.6 Megabytes for both of them even though the 7-zip version was bigger.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4536104670/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4618199016","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119725#issuecomment-4618199016","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119725","id":4618199016,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE0Qf6A","user":{"login":"DeeJayLSP","id":60024671,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDI0Njcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60024671?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP","html_url":"https://github.com/DeeJayLSP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DeeJayLSP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-04T01:37:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-04T02:05:19Z","body":"Tested exporting the [Third Person Shooter demo](https://github.com/godotengine/tps-demo)\r\n\r\n## Pros\r\n\r\nThe final PCK size decreased drastically:\r\n\r\nPCK uncompressed: 857.2 MiB\r\nPCK 7zip (default settings): 278 MiB\r\n\r\n## Cons\r\n\r\n- The project took *several minutes* to export in 7zip, compared to compression disabled which took a few seconds.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\n- The zstd compression option seems to do nothing (same size as uncompressed).\r\n- Memory usage and load times seemed relatively close in both cases.\r\n\r\nWhile the idea is good, I'd probably look into applying the same with existing compression formats, before introducing a whole new compression library. Probably look into Zstd, which already has many options in the Project Settings, or maybe even Brotli, which is a big win against Zlib but loses against Zstd on everything except compression ratio (note that Godot currently supports Brotli decompression but not compression).\r\n\r\nA quick estimation (a.k.a. using Zstd for local filesystem compression) tells me a hypothetical Zstd-compressed PCK at maximum level should be less than 363 MiB, but this makes me wonder if `ResourceFormatBinary` is actually applying compression correctly.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, exporting as ZIP instead of PCK yields a 352.9 MiB file.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4618199016/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4618499744","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119725#issuecomment-4618499744","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119725","id":4618499744,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE0i2oA","user":{"login":"RSDNTWK","id":75706303,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NzA2MzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75706303?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.co